OL,3,GNEWSATeen not qualified to fell tree
OL,4,Athat killed him, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apprentice tree surgeon died after
OL,7,Fbeing crushed by a tree he was not
OL,8,Fqualified to fell, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FJonty Parkinson, who was the nephew of
OL,12,FEngland legend Gary Lineker, had been
OL,13,Fworking in woodland on a National Trust
OL,14,Fsite near Faringdon, in Oxfordshire.
OL,16,FOn 6 September 2024, the 18-year-old,
OL,17,Ffrom Cirencester, died from crush
OL,18,Finjuries to his abdomen, caused after a
OL,19,Ftree he partially felled with a
OL,20,Fchainsaw did not fall in the intended
OL,21,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
